{{{ghost/potion spoiler lurking ahead}}}



your gain energy potion was a smoky potion before you identified it. any
smoky potion may have a ghost in it. when the ghost pops out he nearly
frightens you to death (freezing you) but he doesn't usually kill you.
encountering a ghost, you should run for your life. the ghost will
follow you (if you're not invisible) albiet slowly and clumsily. you
can easily out-maneuver the ghost. you may also notice that a blessed
weapon has a better chance of hitting the ghost than an uncursed one.
arbitrary, sort of ... illogical, well ... unfair, not really.

